      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "“Speak, you who ride on white donkeys, you who sit on rich carpets, and you who walk by the way.",
      "ko": "흰 나귀를 탄 자들, 귀한 화문석에 앉은 자들, 길에 행하는 자들아 선파할찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "6590977c4639223d26eeb8a88bcc1332a50ae8c9932e418350756f9275aa72cb",
      "translation_text_hash": "ad2e0c1ba2ec6e4eae91b6ac55a7ca14c5824851f15170da422c93b74b9c2e5a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "흰 나귀를 탄 자들, 귀한 화문석에 앉은 자들, 길에 행하는 자들아 선파할찌어다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ad2e0c1ba2ec6e4eae91b6ac55a7ca14c5824851f15170da422c93b74b9c2e5a"
