      ],
      "en": "The princes of Issachar were with Deborah. As was Issachar, so was Barak. They rushed into the valley at his feet. By the watercourses of Reuben, there were great resolves of heart.",
      "ko": "잇사갈의 방백들이 드보라와 함께하니 잇사갈의 심사를 바락도 가졌도다 그 발을 좇아 골짜기로 달려 내려가니 르우벤 시냇가에 큰 결심이 있었도다",
      "source_text_hash": "957f6c8f48ca8d4d4f303a5a3165361cd412872ddd5d2d0daf3b411ae6709a3d",
      "translation_text_hash": "36c7f88adb635b6bb8230c9c4317e9b8e91338bca84d4d7f11d9c289e5dafa7d",
