      "en": "From the sky the stars fought. From their courses, they fought against Sisera.",
      "ko": "별들이 하늘에서부터 싸우되 그 다니는 길에서 시스라와 싸웠도다",
      "source_text_hash": "eb040793ad9abf190ae4e86ef4d37932829d2396ed2bf40cf8ab33c96c787160",
      "translation_text_hash": "327a50a0961dd28e5d0bc682a3f4f2eebb3dda60c1bb840fe92d0c27fb77657c",
