      "en": "Then the horse hoofs stamped because of the prancing, the prancing of their strong ones.",
      "ko": "그 때에 군마가 빨리 달리니 말굽소리는 땅을 울리도다",
      "source_text_hash": "8026446d7d2e7bed9e85ee4ef58d8f8383816fceb5a9fbd1f62f895628a01739",
      "translation_text_hash": "0920029f9fa1341f55429e36e3b2ccd7763552c6b9e3d1ee22e7c0428dca961e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
