      "en": "He asked for water. She gave him milk. She brought him butter in a lordly dish.",
      "ko": "시스라가 물을 구하매 우유를 주되 곧 엉긴 젖을 귀한 그릇에 담아주었고",
      "source_text_hash": "5692b58480f34e695f9c5cdf80c56a5488e733838ca1eb1aa23e6c4bcb7ed5e0",
      "translation_text_hash": "0b3b9a3e00bc96abccf23208607d26cf4aafc350be0c9bc0b4ab21aa9acaa80b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "시스라가 물을 구하매 우유를 주되 곧 엉긴 젖을 귀한 그릇에 담아주었고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
