      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 27
        }
      ],
      "en": "At her feet he bowed, he fell, he lay. At her feet he bowed, he fell. Where he bowed, there he fell down dead.",
      "ko": "그가 그의 발 앞에 꾸부러지며 엎드러지고 쓰러졌고 그의 발 앞에 꾸부러져 엎드러져서 그 꾸부러진 곳에 엎드러져 죽었도다",
      "source_text_hash": "bf81b6648a79e6e1eba13689e5b5a3061eee9cf17ffb98a13134509adf4a0ff4",
